url: 'https://concrete-screening-app.streamlit.app/'
abstract: >-
  A human-in-the-loop agent that automates durability compliance
  screening of concrete products. The tool evaluates Environmental
  Product Declarations against project-specific requirements,
  integrating regulatory schemas (EN 206, AS 3600), LLM-based
  extraction from technical drawings and EPD documents, and
  user-defined constraints.
keywords:
  - concrete
  - compliance screening
  - environmental product declaration
  - exposure classes
  - large language models
  - human-in-the-loop
